# Contributing

This service uses the `{{ENGINE}}` HTTP engine and the `minimal` profile. Keep native HTTP handlers in `internal/handlers/http`. Keep application startup and shutdown in `internal/app`.

Run `make check-all` before committing. Tests do not require external infrastructure. Add tests for changed request parsing, validation, response behavior, and dependency lifecycle when adding dependencies.

Persistence, bundled application features, workers, and automatic SQL CRUD wiring are omitted. Add the dependencies and lifecycle required by your service explicitly. Editing `.gobase.json` does not install features or convert the output.
